resources.string:
Reply with a single JSON object (no markdown, no code fences, no commentary):
{ "briefText": "3–4 sentences in English, max 500 characters, written STRICTLY in the assigned persona", "mood": "short mood label in English reflecting the persona, max 4 words", "moodDescription": "one atmospheric sentence in English matching the persona, max 16 words", "outfitSuggestion": "2–3 garments in English, max 6 words", "genres": ["genre1", "genre2", "genre3"] }
briefText, mood, moodDescription, outfitSuggestion are in English. genres are in English regardless of language.
REMINDER — the entire JSON content (especially briefText, mood and moodDescription) MUST read as if written by this exact persona: {tone_reminder}
